Z||000003||Cliff Pennock||12-03-1999||03:39 AM||||No really Patrick, I <B>really</B> don't mind! I think I've even supplied those links myself in the past. Above all, this is a forum to discuss <I>anything</I> Fiero related, even if it is the competition's Digital Dashboard.<P>&lt;SHAMELESS PLUG&gt;<BR>Besides, my Digital Dashboard is way cooler and has much more options than any other out there!<BR>&lt;/SHAMELESS PLUG&gt;<P>In all honesty, I'm sure Mark's Dash works fine - but it's ugly...<P>Greg: First of all I'm sorry I hadn't replied to your email. I receive quite a lot of email and I sometimes loose track of which ones I had answered and which not. And yes, I will still be offering a few FDD-X1s for an introductory price of $500. That will probably happen somewhere in the first few months of 2000. We still need to finish a few other projects first that needs all our attention.||||reg||7
